===Etymology===
{{etymon|en|id=physical frame|inh|enm>bodi>body|tree=1}}
From {{inh|en|enm|bodi}}, {{m|enm|bodiȝ}}, from {{inh|en|ang|bodiġ||body, trunk, chest, torso, height, stature}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*bodag||body, trunk}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*bʰewdʰ-|t=to be awake, observe}}. Cognate with {{cog|goh|botah}} (whence {{cog|swg|Bottich|t=body, torso}}).

